From 350a442717d5a4b99cc56ea6bc5a4f4b29cf9be9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SMARK2022 <3222301373@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 13:06:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Refactor tests and add new functionality

- Update `defaultAgent` test to reflect changes in expected behavior when build is disabled.
- Introduce new tests for `diffLineStats` to validate line counting logic in TUI diff display.
- Add tests for TUI-required fields in `Flag` to ensure proper boolean definitions.
- Implement integration tests for the Session route to verify critical TUI features and integration points.
- Create tests for smooth scrollbar markers and ensure `drawSmoothScrollbar` is callable.
- Enhance config tests to utilize `spyOn` for better fetch routing and mock implementations.
- Update session list tests to include path ancestor building and global parent session checks.
- Modify session compaction tests to reflect changes in user constraints and preferences.
- Refactor tool read tests to improve structure and add new cases for XML-sensitive content handling.
- Introduce new tests for visible context in tool read operations, ensuring proper stubbing behavior.
- Add outline extraction tests for various programming languages to validate conservative label extraction.

